SOURCE_FILE@0..53
  BLOCK@0..53
    COMMENT@0..40 "# The file ends inside an interpolation."
    NEWLINE@40..41 "\n"
    ASSIGN_STMT@41..52
      NAME_REF@41..42
        LNAME@41..42 "a"
      WHITESPACE@42..43 " "
      EQ@43..44 "="
      WHITESPACE@44..45 " "
      INTERP_STRING@45..52
        STR_BEGIN@45..50 "\"x #{"
        WHITESPACE@50..51 " "
        NAME_REF@51..52
          LNAME@51..52 "y"
        STR_END@52..52 ""
    NEWLINE@52..53 "\n"
  EOF@53..53 ""
---
error@48..50 2:8: an interpolation in a one-line string must close on the line where it opens: add the missing `}`, or use a heredoc `"""` for text on several lines
